Source: Department of State, Central Files, 798.11/5–1561. Confidential;
                    Priority. Drafted by Lindquist and
                        Bell on May 29; cleared by Wallner, Tyler, and McConaughy;
                    and approved by Bowles. Also sent
                    priority to Paris for Rusk and repeated to The Hague, Kuala Lumpur, Canberra,
                    Moscow, London, CINCPAC, and USUN.
